'''Professor A.''' (教授, ''Kyōju'', '''Professor''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Master A.]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

